    "- Statistical and frequency analysis.",
    "- Known plaintext, chosen plaintext, chosen ciphertext, ciphertext-only.",
    "- Meet-in-the-middle (why 2DES adds little); man-in-the-middle (on-path).",
    "- Birthday attack (hash collisions); collision attacks against MD5/SHA-1.",
    "- Replay attack (counter with timestamps, nonces, session tokens).",
    "- Side-channel attacks (timing, power analysis, electromagnetic, acoustic) and fault injection.",
    "- Pass-the-hash and Kerberos attacks; rainbow tables (counter with salting); differential and linear cryptanalysis.",
    "- Ransomware: encrypts data for extortion, often with exfiltration (double extortion); paying may violate OFAC sanctions; offline or immutable backups are the key defense."
