    "- Reporting and documenting investigations: keep detailed notes, maintain integrity of the report.",
    "- Major categories of computer crime: military and intelligence attacks, business attacks (espionage), financial attacks, terrorist attacks, grudge attacks (disgruntled employees), thrill attacks (script kiddies), hacktivist attacks.",
    "## Ethics",
