    "- Organizational codes of ethics define expected behavior. RFC 1087 (Ethics and the Internet) lists unacceptable actions: seeking unauthorized access, disrupting intended use of the internet, wasting resources (people, capacity, computer), destroying integrity of information, compromising user privacy. The Ten Commandments of Computer Ethics (Computer Ethics Institute) is another reference."
